---
source: crates/test-framework/src/snapshot/mod.rs
description: "Query: tpch_q8"
---
+---------------+--------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------+
| plan_type     | plan                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                     |
+---------------+--------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------+
| logical_plan  | Federated                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                |
|               |  Sort: all_nations.o_year ASC NULLS LAST                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                 |
|               |   Projection: all_nations.o_year, sum(CASE WHEN all_nations.nation = Utf8("BRAZIL") THEN all_nations.volume ELSE Int64(0) END) / sum(all_nations.volume) AS mkt_share                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                    |
|               |     Aggregate: groupBy=[[all_nations.o_year]], aggr=[[sum(CASE WHEN all_nations.nation = Utf8("BRAZIL") THEN all_nations.volume ELSE Int64(0) END), sum(all_nations.volume)]]                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                            |
|               |       SubqueryAlias: all_nations                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                         |
|               |         Projection: date_part(Utf8("YEAR"), ducklake.main.orders.o_orderdate) AS o_year, ducklake.main.lineitem.l_extendedprice * (Int64(1) - ducklake.main.lineitem.l_discount) AS volume, n2.n_name AS nation                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                          |
|               |           Inner Join:  Filter: n1.n_regionkey = ducklake.main.region.r_regionkey                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                         |
|               |             Inner Join:  Filter: ducklake.main.supplier.s_nationkey = n2.n_nationkey                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                     |
|               |               Inner Join:  Filter: ducklake.main.customer.c_nationkey = n1.n_nationkey                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                   |
|               |                 Inner Join:  Filter: ducklake.main.orders.o_custkey = ducklake.main.customer.c_custkey                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                   |
|               |                   Inner Join:  Filter: ducklake.main.lineitem.l_orderkey = ducklake.main.orders.o_orderkey                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                               |
|               |                     Inner Join:  Filter: ducklake.main.part.p_partkey = ducklake.main.lineitem.l_partkey AND ducklake.main.supplier.s_suppkey = ducklake.main.lineitem.l_suppkey                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                         |
|               |                       Cross Join:                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                        |
|               |                         TableScan: ducklake.main.part projection=[p_partkey], full_filters=[ducklake.main.part.p_type = Utf8("ECONOMY ANODIZED STEEL")]                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                  |
|               |                         TableScan: ducklake.main.supplier projection=[s_suppkey, s_nationkey]                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                            |
|               |                       TableScan: ducklake.main.lineitem projection=[l_orderkey, l_partkey, l_suppkey, l_extendedprice, l_discount]                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                       |
|               |                     TableScan: ducklake.main.orders projection=[o_orderkey, o_custkey, o_orderdate], full_filters=[ducklake.main.orders.o_orderdate BETWEEN CAST(Utf8("1995-01-01") AS Date32) AND CAST(Utf8("1996-12-31") AS Date32)]                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                   |
|               |                   TableScan: ducklake.main.customer projection=[c_custkey, c_nationkey]                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                  |
|               |                 SubqueryAlias: n1                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                        |
|               |                   TableScan: ducklake.main.nation projection=[n_nationkey, n_regionkey]                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                  |
|               |               SubqueryAlias: n2                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                          |
|               |                 TableScan: ducklake.main.nation projection=[n_nationkey, n_name]                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                         |
|               |             TableScan: ducklake.main.region projection=[r_regionkey], full_filters=[ducklake.main.region.r_name = Utf8("AMERICA")]                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                       |
| physical_plan | SchemaCastScanExec                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                       |
|               |   CooperativeExec                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                        |
|               |     BytesProcessedExec                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                   |
|               |       VirtualExecutionPlan name=duckdb compute_context=:memory: base_sql=SELECT "all_nations"."o_year", (sum(CASE WHEN ("all_nations"."nation" = 'BRAZIL') THEN "all_nations"."volume" ELSE 0 END) // sum("all_nations"."volume")) AS "mkt_share" FROM (SELECT date_part('YEAR', "orders"."o_orderdate") AS "o_year", ("lineitem"."l_extendedprice" * (1 - "lineitem"."l_discount")) AS "volume", "n2"."n_name" AS "nation" FROM "ducklake"."main"."part" CROSS JOIN "ducklake"."main"."supplier" INNER JOIN "ducklake"."main"."lineitem" ON (("part"."p_partkey" = "lineitem"."l_partkey") AND ("supplier"."s_suppkey" = "lineitem"."l_suppkey")) INNER JOIN "ducklake"."main"."orders" ON ("lineitem"."l_orderkey" = "orders"."o_orderkey") INNER JOIN "ducklake"."main"."customer" ON ("orders"."o_custkey" = "customer"."c_custkey") INNER JOIN "ducklake"."main"."nation" AS "n1" ON ("customer"."c_nationkey" = "n1"."n_nationkey") INNER JOIN "ducklake"."main"."nation" AS "n2" ON ("supplier"."s_nationkey" = "n2"."n_nationkey") INNER JOIN "ducklake"."main"."region" ON ("n1"."n_regionkey" = "region"."r_regionkey") WHERE ("part"."p_type" = 'ECONOMY ANODIZED STEEL') AND ("orders"."o_orderdate" BETWEEN CAST('1995-01-01' AS DATE) AND CAST('1996-12-31' AS DATE)) AND ("region"."r_name" = 'AMERICA')) AS "all_nations" GROUP BY "all_nations"."o_year" ORDER BY "all_nations"."o_year" ASC NULLS LAST |
|               |                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                          |
+---------------+--------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------+
